{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.dili.2021b.q27.material.recovered", "text": "材料一：巴音郭勒河位于柴达木盆地东部，发源于祁连山，全程200千米，蓄集峡以上河段山势陡峻，河谷深切，水流湍急，巴音郭勒河出蓄集峡后注入可鲁克湖，可鲁克湖又与托素湖以水道相通，两湖一咸一淡，因巴音郭勒河夏季多发洪水灾害，政府决定对巴音郭勒河（德令哈市段）进行河道综合整治。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "5bad08553db0dcce949d7b4ed1108dec7ceb98dfa08e1608e158a7cd855ab02e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2435, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2571, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "5bad08553db0dcce949d7b4ed1108dec7ceb98dfa08e1608e158a7cd855ab02e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.dili.2021b.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.dili.s1.k05", "ntce.gaozhong.dili.s1.k12"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.411.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.dili.2021b.q27"], "word_count": 136, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "dili", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "5bad08553db0dcce949d7b4ed1108dec7ceb98dfa08e1608e158a7cd855ab02e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2435, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2571, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《高中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "5bad08553db0dcce949d7b4ed1108dec7ceb98dfa08e1608e158a7cd855ab02e"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"auth